# SP0 step 2: the guide's own files are in the clone, and this milestone is
# registered so CI checks it from now on.
# Format: file | regular expression the file must contain | message if it doesn't
docs/overview.md | ^# | the overview is part of the seed
docs/milestones/SP0.md | ^# SP0: Create the GitHub repo$ | this brief is part of the seed
.github/scripts/check.sh | milestones\.txt | the check runner reads the milestone list
.github/scripts/check.sh | tofu | the runner uses OpenTofu, not Terraform
milestones.txt | ^SP0$ | SP0 must be registered, or CI checks nothing on this branch
